    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe87d8e07345aa6da07844d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这么说可能有点怪──不过跟那些\n听完别人的忠告依然容易失控的人相比，\n麦昆则是会确实给予回应。",
      "source_fingerprint": "816709e51fb0a3357893bef9746c17d78afb6d28c21acfbd779e206b5d821c19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
