    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55d1a25424093505d719651d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆的认真及坦率──\n身为她的训练员，\n这些地方我的确多少能理解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7693445188f9de19190d71d1392e5dba4053ef33cdf48736b0b04981eb0bf35c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
