    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c78f754495bafb746edcb4a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，你也这么认为啊！\n果然麦昆她不但勤勉，又很努力，\n而且学习能力又强──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e044ad65f92fb593b70f1c7a13ad6201253e0a13176f38f92d2d92bf3edeb507",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013800.json",
