      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，谢谢你。\n多亏这样，我觉得稍微轻松些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1e3434e661e53e71040bb9d30cac2121cdc688ebb177f84a18c29bfcf1230ec",
