      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢谢你。不过我也很留心自己的事，\n所以请不用担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "112d64fa7e5875ac6c567ae3e50b3ceb8b1c1bc7b6aa1ca123b594cc97aee9ba",
